 another yelena clone  disguised as her in order to throw off  hawkeye and the winter soldier  but not before she killed the real elena  then she killed the clones as well to  put an end to her friend and rival once  and for all  at least until the character likely gets  a well-earned reboot following the black  widow film  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite comic book heroes and  villains are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

